      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#FFD27A>TIPS</color>\n\u2022 Grab orbs in quick succession for a <color=#FFD27A>combo</color>: up to x6 score\n\u2022 Slip past obstacles closely for a <color=#7FE8FF>near miss</color> bonus\n\u2022 Catch the reflection of a <color=#FFD27A>golden shooting star</color> for Starburst: x2 points\n\u2022 The lighthouse beam reveals <color=#7FE8FF>hidden orbs</color>\n\u2022 Storms, auroras and a <color=#7FE8FF>giant glowing whale</color> appear as you sail on. Find the gap in its waves!"
